{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03415",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.84,
      "end_seconds": 6.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor. They're in and comfortable, and I have the measurements ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.16,
      "end_seconds": 11.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.16,
      "end_seconds": 23.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "Honestly, um, it's a pearly bump on my nose that bleeds, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.1,
      "end_seconds": 29.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.5,
      "end_seconds": 35.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "It's, It's been going on for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.54,
      "end_seconds": 39.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.11,
      "end_seconds": 56.25,
      "duration_seconds": 12.14,
      "text": "It usually comes with crusting. Right, the crusting? That's been for six months. There's a sore that won't heal as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.15,
      "end_seconds": 66.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "Have you had a pearly bump on your nose that bleeds before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.91,
      "end_seconds": 77.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, a bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.71,
      "end_seconds": 81.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Any other new lumps or swollen glands at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.94,
      "end_seconds": 88.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "No other new lumps or swollen glands, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.86,
      "end_seconds": 92.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Have you noticed family history of skin cancer or pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.55,
      "end_seconds": 97.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.29,
      "end_seconds": 101.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.54,
      "end_seconds": 104.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.08,
      "end_seconds": 108.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.78,
      "end_seconds": 111.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.31,
      "end_seconds": 115.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.32,
      "end_seconds": 130.74,
      "duration_seconds": 13.42,
      "text": "Migraines, for five years. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. Anxiety, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.96,
      "end_seconds": 135.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Alright, anxiety, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.84,
      "end_seconds": 157.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.91,
      "end_seconds": 162.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Oh, you know, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.85,
      "end_seconds": 166.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.65,
      "end_seconds": 170.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "It's sumatriptan, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.61,
      "end_seconds": 172.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.01,
      "end_seconds": 190.13,
      "duration_seconds": 11.12,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. Hmm, it's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.72,
      "end_seconds": 191.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.15,
      "end_seconds": 206.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.67,
      "end_seconds": 214.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.4,
      "end_seconds": 216.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.35,
      "end_seconds": 221.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.1,
      "end_seconds": 226.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Right, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.17,
      "end_seconds": 231.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.49,
      "end_seconds": 235.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.92,
      "end_seconds": 241.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 243.14,
      "end_seconds": 250.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Saturation 97 percent, BP is 118 over 80. Temperature is 36.8 degrees, pulse 64."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.87,
      "end_seconds": 253.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.74,
      "end_seconds": 259.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.39,
      "end_seconds": 262.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.11,
      "end_seconds": 285.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "There is a pearly nodule with fine surface vessels and a central dip on the side of the nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.58,
      "end_seconds": 305.15,
      "duration_seconds": 17.57,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Having listened and examined, this looks most like a likely basal cell carcinoma. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Another possibility is a squamous cell carcinoma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.61,
      "end_seconds": 328.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a dermoscopy because of suspicious lesion. Let's book a skin biopsy to look into suspicious lesion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.47,
      "end_seconds": 335.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.17,
      "end_seconds": 357.33,
      "duration_seconds": 20.16,
      "text": "Please use a high-factor sunscreen and a hat. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Let's review you after the biopsy. Alright, how would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.39,
      "end_seconds": 364.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "So, I come back after the biopsy. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.99,
      "end_seconds": 368.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.46,
      "end_seconds": 373.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}